# === Composed-bilateral #53 closure landscape at narrative altitude ===
#
# This species declares NO new sub-predicates of the family-root's
# `song_settles` composed bilateral (14th #53 instance per
# `[[architecture-property-fracture-bilateral]]`). The relationship:
#
#   family-root `song_settles(pr, p)` composes:
#     progression_directed_toward_cadence(pr, p) [@song/progression, `54ff1e8`]
#       AND voice_line_valid(v, p)                 [@song/voice, `cc5a440`]
#       AND cadence_authentic_or_plagal(c, p)      [@song/progression, `54ff1e8`]
#
# ALL THREE SUB-PREDICATES ALREADY DECLARED AND DISCHARGED at TICK 3.
# Narrative CONSUMES this composed bilateral at the transmit boundary
# (the `transmit` action at species altitude) — the narrative's
# transmit event fires when `song_settles` discharges at Splinter-pole
# across all three sub-predicates AND the wire-projection at
# `@io/stagefreight/narrative` completes at its `stagefreight_
# addressable` bilateral. The species does NOT emit a new sub-predicate
# row; it CONSUMES the fully-composed bilateral verdict at the
# `transmit` action.
#
# Splinter-pole (`pass`) at narrative altitude: the family-root's
# composed bilateral discharges at Splinter-pole across all three
# sub-predicates; the narrative's arc closes with the epoch settled;
# the `transmit` action ships the narrative through
# `@io/stagefreight/narrative` at the wire altitude; the corpus gains a
# new sheaf section over the organisational manifold.
#
# Narcissus-pole (`failure`) at narrative altitude: the family-root's
# composed bilateral fails at Narcissus-pole through one or more sub-
# predicate:
#   - `progression_directed_toward_cadence` FAIL → SILENCE (the
#     narrative arc cannot close; the epoch hangs unresolved; the
#     sheaf section is incomplete).
#   - `voice_line_valid` FAIL → GLUE WORK (the narrative's contrapuntal
#     labor invisibly holds the polyphony but is not attributed; the
#     epoch's authorial credit is erased in the corpus).
#   - `cadence_authentic_or_plagal` FAIL → EXTRACTION (the narrative
#     appears to close but has extracted regulation stock without
#     replenishing; the epoch's closure is deceptive in the corpus).
#
# The `alignment-as-boundary-mathematics` discipline (#57) at
# consolidation altitude names WHICH sub-claim broke; the narrative's
# `transmit` action does NOT re-audit the bilateral (it already
# discharged at species altitude in TICK 3); it consumes the
# discharged verdict and translates it to the wire-projection dispatch
# decision AND the corpus-inclusion decision.
#
# Sibling composed bilaterals at other family-root/species altitudes:
# `@container.container_runnable`, `@io/oci.oci_well_formed`,
# `@io/stagefreight.stagefreight_addressable`, `@cascade.cascade_well_defined`,
# `@docblock.audit_docblock`, `@smarts/shatter.shatter_round_trip`,
# `@reflection.third_order_coherent`, `@epistemologic/neutrosophic.three_axis_coherent`,
# `@kintsugi/shift.shift_preserves_content`, `@song.song_settles`
# (parent; fully discharged at TICK 3). This species is the SECOND
